# =============================================================================
#  DKSI Computational Design Assistant
# =============================================================================

# ---- build output -----------------------------------------------------------
bin/
obj/
.vs/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo

# ---- Revit binaries ---------------------------------------------------------
#
# Excluded BY EXTENSION rather than by folder, deliberately. The model folders
# also hold the original Dynamo graphs (*.dyn) that the C# tools were ported
# from, and those are the closest thing to a specification this project has -
# they belong in history. Ignoring the folders wholesale would lose them.
#
# 1.2 GB of .rvt and .rte sits in this tree. Git stores binaries whole, with no
# delta compression, so one committed model is 200 MB in the repo forever, on
# every clone, even after it is deleted.
*.rvt
*.rte
*.rfa
*.rft
*.dwg
*.ifc
*.nwc
*.nwd

# Revit's own backups and recovery files
*.[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].rvt
*_backup/
*.slog
*.dmp

# ---- installer output -------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerable from build-installer.ps1 in seconds, and 2 MB per version.
# VERSION.txt inside the package records what a given ZIP contained.
#
# Covers BOTH installers this repo turns out to contain: the WiX/MSI one under
# Revit Add-in/, and the newer script-based one under Installer/. That overlap is
# a real duplication to resolve, not a naming accident - see the README note.
dist/
Installer/staging/
*.msi
*.wixpdb

# ---- generated reports ------------------------------------------------------
# The tools write CSVs and logs beside the model. They are outputs, not source.
Vision Modeler/
*-dryrun-*.csv
lining-current-*.csv
lining-current-*.log

# ---- secrets ----------------------------------------------------------------
# No key has ever been committed here and none should be. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is
# read from the environment at runtime; if a .env ever appears, it stays local.
.env
*.key
appsettings.Local.json

# ---- OS ---------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
